window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Betraying Kadoc changed everything.</b></p> <p>Now he's lost to his bloodlust, more beast than man, and the bond building between us has basically been reset. </p> <p>My effect on him has dwindled to nearly nothing, but I'm the only one who can calm him, so I've got to figure out something. </p> <p>When the massive bone dragon from the prison island recomposes sooner than expected and escapes, it's clear that I have to get Kadoc's bloodlust under control for the both of us…. </p> <p>Because if I don't, our entire world might burn.</p> <p><b>This romantic fantasy was lightly inspired by </b><b><i>Beauty and the Beast</i></b><b> and is recommended for ages 17+ due to sexual content.</b></p>"; 
